# Permissao por topico. Deny by default: o que nao esta aqui, nao passa.
# Canon dos topicos: docs/mqtt.md (state retained, schedule espelhado pelo
# firmware, comandos so via cmd/#).

# O alimentador cuida apenas do proprio ramo.
user feeder-sp01
topic write feeder/sp01/state
topic write feeder/sp01/schedule
topic write feeder/sp01/config
topic write feeder/sp01/event
topic read  feeder/sp01/cmd/#

# O app comanda e observa. A agenda ele PEDE por cmd/schedule e LE o espelho:
# quem escreve em feeder/+/schedule e so o firmware.
user app-giovanni
topic read  feeder/+/state
topic read  feeder/+/schedule
topic read  feeder/+/config
topic read  feeder/+/event
topic write feeder/+/cmd/#
